{"time": 1753419550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711655841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神还正好两张卡，你也不用车）"}
{"time": 1753419631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115447420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1200230174]“有事上奏无事退朝……哎算了”门内传来脚步声，随后她给你开了门，衣着上相当休闲"}
{"time": 1753419644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322084678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=488908640]（）"}
{"time": 1753419865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72057635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2115447420]“喝过药之后好多了呢？”手指拂过自己的头发，甩甩头，“所以，刚刚去接了一个任务，”点点头，“绘梨衣大人能不能一起啦，报酬分你一半。”"}
{"time": 1753419910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740820053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就好，对方还挺阴险的，居然扔闪光弹炸我们”取一下素材"}
{"time": 1753420066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043680430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=72057635]“不行”绘梨衣摇头，双鬓交替追击彼此“我要按劳分配”"}
{"time": 1753420136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347100950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1740820053]“能活下来，就不算阴险”沧澜环顾一圈，似乎没看到什么值得担心的，于是转身回溪边清洗身上的血迹"}
{"time": 1753420244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "139178773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“开个玩笑，毕竟我扔的更早”"}
{"time": 1753420339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403648330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没绷住）"}
{"time": 1753420351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578489898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1043680430]“诶？”有些好笑地看着她，“按劳分配？怎么突然这么说？”"}
{"time": 1753420521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2968768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=139178773]“那也一样，能赢下来，就不算阴险”她直起腰来“还有个目标吧？”"}
{"time": 1753420587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177185514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=578489898]“因为这样好。你们人类也是这样多吧”"}
{"time": 1753420858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473316604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“哦？”绕着她打量打量，“我们绘梨衣大人这是一夜之间长大了吗？突然懂了这么些道理说是”"}
{"time": 1753421004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924359800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2968768][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “嗯，不知道剩下那个目标在哪，会在另一条路上吗”"}
{"time": 1753421200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062530505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你知道的，毕竟我在车上）"}
{"time": 1753421322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852514180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=473316604]“酒馆里戏最多了”绘梨衣吹了吹自己的头发“一句话，行不行？”"}
{"time": 1753421373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1793178940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1924359800]“不知道”沧澜往那能隐约听到瀑布声的方向看去"}
{"time": 1753421736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302732306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=852514180]“唔嗯，白送绘梨衣大人一半不要的话...我当然不会拒绝你按劳分配的请求啦。”笑眯眯地侧头看着她，“不过这样我都有些于心不忍了，要不绘梨衣还是不去吧？”"}
{"time": 1753421771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028460364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（何意味）"}
{"time": 1753421824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904568033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟，这次任务是要去火山啦。没有什么水分的地方。\""}
{"time": 1753421834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799970882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(于心不忍了)"}
