{"time": 1753426113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604383418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1096708401]总之，废神社离村子说不上太远。等你们走到不容易被人发现、可以起飞的距离，已经几乎要到废神社区域营地了"}
{"time": 1753426176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407412034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后你喜欢的话，我们也可以加入san值系统）"}
{"time": 1753426195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674631249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（或者pf有套独有的类似san的规则，我去查一下（）"}
