{"time": 1753430283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873628708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？好像有点看不懂，不过这神明看起来不是什么好神明的样子..”"}
{"time": 1753430303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749597191", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天色好像不早了。差不多该回去了，要不安姐姐又要担心了”"}
{"time": 1753430352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772116080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=16862559A96AE4CCC659D3BB23239162.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSI_0JJ4QnZPIQc9EojCbp9BLG2ZRjoCyD_CiiJ9_CJxdeOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCEyv-sJU74m1jlaRhhACanegKi9Q&amp;rkey=CAISMEwmXjYDAXDzb-dYl_GtMgq98r3Y_f5KFDjYOmQdLLZMwR1oDKtaxBiT2NtvzT1eTg,file_size=1512]（怎么这么菜（）"}
{"time": 1753430394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "657134718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=749597191]“嗯……”沧澜凑在你旁边跟着看完“这些神明，是真实存在的生物，还是人类想象出来的，还是别的什么？”"}
